    "summary": "Bearer: a **CALLIDUS ASSASSIN** model.\n\n2 times per battle, and at most once per battle round, in [your Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase), another **INFANTRY** model of yours can be picked, provided it is on the battlefield, not in [Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range) of any enemy unit. That model is destroyed without triggering any rules for destroyed models, and then the bearer is taken off the battlefield and placed again as near as it can be to the destroyed model's spot, not in Engagement Range of any enemy unit.",
